This directory contains a modified subset of the Presenton slide editor.
UPSTREAM.json records original file paths and hashes.
Reizo modifications: local relative module boundaries, host-managed persistence,
local image/icon pickers, bundled chart runtime, removal of Redux publishing and
analytics calls, and compatibility with Reizo's React/Tiptap versions.
The separately distributed Presenton export-core is not included or used.
